#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""omarchy-buds: Galaxy Buds daemon and control CLI for the Omarchy bar.

One file, two jobs:

  omarchy-buds daemon [--debug]   long-running: talks to the buds over Samsung's
                                  SPP channel through BlueZ and publishes
                                  $XDG_STATE_HOME/omarchy-buds/status.json
  omarchy-buds <verb> [args]      one-shot: hands a command to the daemon over
                                  its control socket and prints the reply

The wire protocol is the one Samsung's own app speaks over RFCOMM. Everything
known about it here comes from timschneeb's GalaxyBudsClient, which
reverse-engineered it; see README.md for credits. Only python-gobject is
needed, and Omarchy already ships it.
"""

